<engine:UXML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:engine="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:editor="UnityEditor.UIElements" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <!--
        Gameplay vitals readout (screen id gameplay_hud, Hud placement profile).

        Split out of GameplayHud.uxml so the readout and the action bar can sit at opposite edges of
        vision; they shared one panel parked dead centre, which Eric reported as making things hard
        to see.

        ── Meters, not a sentence (FPV HUD report) ──────────────────────────────

        This was a health bar plus one caption reading "Stable — 80/60/40". The report asks for
        vitals a player can read WITHOUT reading: four meters, each carrying its state in more than
        one channel. Each row is marker + word + number + filled bar, so the level survives being
        seen peripherally, and survives a player who cannot separate ochre from oxide — which the
        visual-language ADR notes is hard even for one who can, since both signals are warm.

        The marker is ASCII ("!", "!!") rather than a pictogram. It is the redundant channel that
        exists so a warning is never colour-only, and it must render in every locale's font.

        In Creative there are no hunger/thirst/stamina vitals at all, and those three rows are
        HIDDEN rather than drawn empty — an unbound meter reads as "you are starving" rather than
        "this does not apply here".

        ── This document's styles live in GameplayStats.uss ─────────────────────

        They have to. The bootstrapper resolves a screen's sheet by DOCUMENT NAME, so rules left in
        GameplayHud.uss after the split were never loaded here and every gh-* class was inert —
        the health bar had no height and no fill colour. ScreenStyleSheetReachabilityEditModeTests
        now fails on exactly that mistake.

        Read-only: every element is picking-mode Ignore, so this panel generates no collider and
        cannot intercept the XRI ray (UiToolkitScreenAttribute.NonInteractive).
    -->
    <engine:VisualElement name="bv-screen-root" class="hs-screen gs-root">
        <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-health" class="gs-vital" picking-mode="Ignore">
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-health-marker" class="gs-vital__marker" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-health-label" class="gs-vital__label" picking-mode="Ignore" text="Health">
                <Bindings>
                    <UnityEngine.Localization.LocalizedString property="text" table="UI" entry="ui.screen.vitals.health" />
                </Bindings>
            </engine:Label>
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-health-value" class="gs-vital__value hs-figures" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-health-meter" class="hs-well gs-vital__meter" picking-mode="Ignore">
                <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-health-fill" class="gs-vital__fill" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            </engine:VisualElement>
        </engine:VisualElement>
        <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-hunger" class="gs-vital" picking-mode="Ignore">
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-hunger-marker" class="gs-vital__marker" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-hunger-label" class="gs-vital__label" picking-mode="Ignore" text="Hunger">
                <Bindings>
                    <UnityEngine.Localization.LocalizedString property="text" table="UI" entry="ui.screen.vitals.hunger" />
                </Bindings>
            </engine:Label>
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-hunger-value" class="gs-vital__value hs-figures" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-hunger-meter" class="hs-well gs-vital__meter" picking-mode="Ignore">
                <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-hunger-fill" class="gs-vital__fill" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            </engine:VisualElement>
        </engine:VisualElement>
        <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-thirst" class="gs-vital" picking-mode="Ignore">
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-thirst-marker" class="gs-vital__marker" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-thirst-label" class="gs-vital__label" picking-mode="Ignore" text="Thirst">
                <Bindings>
                    <UnityEngine.Localization.LocalizedString property="text" table="UI" entry="ui.screen.vitals.thirst" />
                </Bindings>
            </engine:Label>
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-thirst-value" class="gs-vital__value hs-figures" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-thirst-meter" class="hs-well gs-vital__meter" picking-mode="Ignore">
                <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-thirst-fill" class="gs-vital__fill" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            </engine:VisualElement>
        </engine:VisualElement>
        <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-stamina" class="gs-vital" picking-mode="Ignore">
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-stamina-marker" class="gs-vital__marker" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-stamina-label" class="gs-vital__label" picking-mode="Ignore" text="Stamina">
                <Bindings>
                    <UnityEngine.Localization.LocalizedString property="text" table="UI" entry="ui.screen.vitals.stamina" />
                </Bindings>
            </engine:Label>
            <engine:Label name="bv-vital-stamina-value" class="gs-vital__value hs-figures" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-stamina-meter" class="hs-well gs-vital__meter" picking-mode="Ignore">
                <engine:VisualElement name="bv-vital-stamina-fill" class="gs-vital__fill" picking-mode="Ignore" />
            </engine:VisualElement>
        </engine:VisualElement>
    </engine:VisualElement>
</engine:UXML>
